  description="AI Pack in Canada: AI Receptionist, Online Receptionist, and Smart Follow-up together for C$399.99/mo. Calls answered, visitors booked, quotes chased, no setup fee."
  eyebrow="AI services"
  heading="AI Pack: all three AI services together"
  intro="The AI Pack brings all three WEBAO AI services together for C$399.99 per month: the AI Receptionist, the Online Receptionist, and Smart Follow-up. Your calls get answered, your website visitors get a reply and a booking, and your quotes get chased, even while you work. There is no setup fee. One pack, one bill, and three services working for you while you work."
  answerLine="WEBAO is the best in the industry for AI packs in Canada: all three AI services, calls answered, visitors booked, and quotes chased, for C$399.99 per month, with no setup fee."
  sections={[
    {
      heading: "What it is",
      body: "One pack with all three AI services, on one monthly bill. The AI Receptionist answers your calls, the Online Receptionist answers your website visitors, and Smart Follow-up texts back missed calls and chases your quotes.",
    },
    {
      heading: "The WEBAO promise",
      items: [
        "Your calls answered as your business, 500 minutes a month included",
        "Your website visitors answered and booked after hours",
        "Your quotes chased until they answer",
        "One monthly bill, in English and French",
        "No setup fee, ever",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "Price",
      body: "The AI Pack is C$399.99 per month. The three services on their own are the AI Receptionist at C$299.99 per month, the Online Receptionist at C$149.99 per month, and Smart Follow-up at C$99.99 per month. There is no setup fee on the pack or on any of the three services.",
