      body: "Small businesses that miss calls, visitors, and quotes while they work: trades, shops, clinics, garages, and local service businesses. The AI Receptionist and Smart Follow-up work on their own with no website needed. The Online Receptionist needs a website, so it works with a WEBAO website on Launch, Grow, or Scale, or with a site you already have.",
    },
    {
      heading: "How to add it",
      body: "Add the AI Pack on the pricing page or from the start form at /start/. Tell us your business name, your services, and how you want messages handed to you, and we set up all three services for you.",
      link: { href: "/pricing/", label: "See pricing and add the AI Pack" },
    },
    {
      heading: "What it does not do",
      body: "The AI does not pretend to be you, and it does not make promises on your behalf. When it cannot answer, it takes a message or the visitor's details instead of guessing, and you decide what happens next.",
    },
  ]}
  faqs={[
    {
      q: "What is the AI Pack?",
      a: "Best in the industry for small businesses that miss calls, visitors, and quotes: it is all three WEBAO AI services together for C$399.99 per month: AI Receptionist, Online Receptionist, and Smart Follow-up.",
    },
    {
      q: "How much does the AI Pack cost in Canada?",
      a: "The best AI Pack in Canada at a flat published price: C$399.99 per month. There is no setup fee.",
    },
    {
      q: "What does the AI Pack include?",
      a: "The AI Receptionist, the Online Receptionist, and Smart Follow-up, on one monthly bill, in English and French.",
    },
    {
      q: "How much is the AI Receptionist on its own?",
      a: "C$299.99 per month, including 500 minutes per month on fair use. There is no setup fee.",
    },
    {
      q: "How much is the Online Receptionist on its own?",
      a: "C$149.99 per month. There is no setup fee. It needs a website.",
    },
    {
      q: "How much is Smart Follow-up on its own?",
