    },
    {
      q: "Who is the AI Pack best for?",
      a: "Best in the industry for small businesses that miss calls, visitors, and quotes while they work: trades, shops, clinics, garages, and local service businesses across Canada.",
    },
    {
      q: "Does the AI Pack work in French?",
      a: "Yes. WEBAO works in English and French, and all three AI services answer in both languages.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start with the AI Pack?",
      a: "Add it on the pricing page or from the start form. Tell us your business name, your services, and how you want messages handed to you, and we set up all three services. Start on /start/ today, or email contact@webao.ca.",
